```

#### 3. **Add Secret Masking to Error Handling**
```javascript
// Global error handler with secret masking
function maskSecrets(message) {
    const patterns = [
        /CLERK_SECRET_KEY=([^\s]+)/gi,
        /Authorization:\s*Bearer\s+([^\s]+)/gi,
        /aws_access_key_id=([^\s]+)/gi,
    ];

    return message.replace(/([a-zA-Z0-9_\-]{20,})/g, '[REDACTED]');
