```

---

## 📊 Summary

| Aspect | Status | Risk Level |
|--------|--------|------------|
| **Production Secret Management** | ✅ Good (SSM via task definition) | LOW |
| **Development Secret Loading** | ⚠️ Needs validation | MEDIUM |
| **Secret Rotation** | ❌ Not implemented | HIGH |
| **Secret Masking** | ⚠️ Partial (only for display) | MEDIUM |
| **Environment Variable Validation** | ❌ Missing | HIGH |
| **Secret Rotation Health Checks** | ❌ Missing | MEDIUM |

The application has a **reasonable production setup** using AWS SSM for secrets management, but needs improvements in:
